{"id":"385194286158f758","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-immune.md","title":"免疫、有效免疫与简单集","display":"df-immune — 免疫、有效免疫与简单集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-immune","aliases":["43-df-immune"],"display":"df-immune — 免疫、有效免疫与简单集","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.9, Definition 5.16.13, print pp.28–30,66 / PDF pp.48–50,86","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-immune"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-immune</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-immune — 免疫、有效免疫与简单集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.9, Definition 5.16.13, print pp.28–30,66 / PDF pp.48–50,86"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 为标准c.e.集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Immune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |A|=\\infty\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Rightarrow |W_e|&lt;\\infty).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Immune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |A|=\\infty\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Rightarrow |W_e|&lt;\\infty).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |A|=\\infty\\land\\exists b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Rightarrow|W_e|\\le b(e))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |A|=\\infty\\land\\exists b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Rightarrow|W_e|\\le b(e))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>明确无穷性条件，避免有限集合被误称免疫。有效免疫比免疫多一个按程序编号的可计算基数界。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.9, Definition 5.16.13, print pp.28–30,66 / PDF pp.48–50,86。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Immune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |A|=\\infty\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Rightarrow |W_e|<\\infty).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow |A|=\\infty\\land\\exists b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Rightarrow|W_e|\\le b(e))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A).","display":true}],"bytes":1325,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-immune]] — 免疫、有效免疫与简单集"},{"id":"9167d626040602f0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Hypersimple}$、$\\operatorname{Simple}$、$\\operatorname{Immune}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-hypersimple]]、[[43-df-immune]]；强数组见 [[43-df-strong-array]]。"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","f357216a7edb035a"]}